{"id": "office-depot-city-contract-pricing", "title": "San Francisco auditors found at least $5.75 million in office-supply overcharges", "seconds": 54.2, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "f2378550d968d343", "words": 157, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A City audit found that the pricing of office supplies reduced promised discounts.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.21, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Which", "discounts", "reached", "the", "City?"], "sub": "Office Depot contract"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.44, 0.71, 0.95, 1.1, 1.22, 1.59, 1.72, 2.05, 2.55, 2.95, 3.35]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["amount"], "text": "The Controller estimated at least 5.75 million dollars in overcharges.", "t0": 4.33, "t1": 8.64, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$5.75 million", "label": "Minimum overcharges estimated by the audit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.65, 1.13, 1.23, 1.48, 1.77, 2.04, 2.36, 2.65, 2.96, 3.29, 3.4]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Auditors examined purchases from January 2005 through July 2009.", "t0": 8.76, "t1": 13.63, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller, City Services Auditor", "text": "January 2005 through July 2009", "mark": "January 2005 through July 2009"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.46, 0.92, 1.43, 1.64, 2.16, 2.32, 2.67, 3.02, 3.29, 3.65, 3.83, 4.19]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "They estimated missed savings on items outside the approved price lists.", "t0": 13.75, "t1": 17.89, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Audit findings", "heading": "Two pricing issues", "source": "audit", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Estimated missed discounts", "value": "$4,381,019"}, {"icon": "audit", "label": "Reduced discounts from price floors", "value": "$1,310,053"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.74, 1.07, 1.53, 1.7, 2.04, 2.52, 2.62, 3.02, 3.37]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "For that estimate, they used the average 70 percent discount for Section B items.", "t0": 18.01, "t1": 22.22, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Section B discounts"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.4, 0.89, 1.08, 1.27, 1.42, 1.79, 2.16, 2.51, 2.99, 3.15, 3.56, 3.77]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "They separately found that price floors reduced discounts on other purchases.", "t0": 22.34, "t1": 26.27, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller, City Services Auditor", "text": "Price floors", "mark": "Price floors"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.71, 0.93, 1.09, 1.39, 1.8, 2.18, 2.68, 2.82, 3.03]}, {"scene": "settlement", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "All 11 supervisors approved the settlement on March 1, 2011.", "t0": 26.49, "t1": 30.57, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "board", "kicker": "San Francisco Board of Supervisors", "text": "March 1, 2011", "mark": "March 1, 2011"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.59, 1.18, 1.58, 1.69, 2.19, 2.34, 2.62, 3.04, 3.39]}, {"scene": "settlement", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The terms called for a 3.75 million dollar check and a separate purchasing credit.", "t0": 30.69, "t1": 35.85, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Settlement terms", "heading": "Check and purchasing credit", "source": "terms", "rows": [{"icon": "transfer", "label": "Check to the City", "value": "$3.75 million"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Five-year purchasing credit", "value": "$500,000"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.52, 0.91, 1.06, 1.13, 1.39, 1.67, 1.99, 2.23, 2.53, 2.8, 3.47, 3.77, 3.88, 4.27, 4.73]}, {"scene": "settlement", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[1]"], "text": "The credit could be used for five years.", "t0": 35.97, "t1": 38.11, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Five years"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.45, 0.63, 0.8, 1.08, 1.25, 1.56]}, {"scene": "settlement", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The City agreed to pay 48,915.40 dollars on its own outstanding invoices.", "t0": 38.23, "t1": 44.43, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "terms", "kicker": "San Francisco City Attorney", "text": "Outstanding City invoices", "mark": "Outstanding City invoices"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.44, 0.74, 0.85, 1.06, 1.51, 1.97, 2.22, 2.51, 2.92, 3.31, 3.46, 3.8, 4.1, 4.22, 4.38, 4.62, 5.26]}, {"scene": "settlement", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "Office Depot denied overcharging.", "t0": 44.55, "t1": 46.62, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Office Depot disputed the audit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.4, 0.76, 1.13]}, {"scene": "settlement", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "next[0]"], "text": "The available records do not show the final amount collected or the credit used.", "t0": 46.74, "t1": 50.8, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Cash receipts", "Purchasing credit used"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.63, 1.0, 1.13, 1.32, 1.56, 1.69, 1.98, 2.27, 2.96, 3.14, 3.24, 3.57]}, {"scene": "settlement", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 50.92, "t1": 53.29, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.72, 0.94, 1.27, 1.38, 1.49, 1.76, 2.01]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The price lists", "settlement": "The Board-approved terms"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "number"}